<section class="about-section">
  <h2>About This App</h2>
  <p>This is a starter web application built using <strong>Express.js</strong> and <strong>EJS</strong> (Embedded JavaScript templates).</p>
  
  <h3>Key Features:</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Configured EJS view engine with partials (header, footer, navbar)</li>
    <li>Static asset serving from <code>/public</code> (CSS, JS, images)</li>
    <li>URL-encoded and JSON body parsing middleware enabled</li>
    <li>Clean 404 error handling page</li>
  </ul>
</section>

